      "date": "2026-01-16T09:58:00.000Z",
      "title": "Sujala Trading & Holdings Ltd Announces Resignation of Aakansha Vaid as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective January 13, 2026",
      "body": "Sujala Trading & Holdings Ltd. announced that Ms. Aakansha Vaid resigned from her position as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company to pursue an alternate career outside of the organization. The Board of Directors accepted her resignation at its meeting held on January 16, 2026, with her last date of employment being January 13, 2026.",
